      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Only through ApplySpecs",
      "items": [
        "Skip and Take apply when the spec runs via Query<TEntity> or Query<TEntity, TModel>",
        "ApplySpecs is internal; use IRepositorySpec.Query or materialization helpers",
        "IgnoreQueryFilters bypasses ignorable filters only, never ownership isolation"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The two other read shapes",
      "items": [
        "ModelSpecification<TEntity, TModel> projects and is always no-tracking",
        "ToKeysetPageAsync needs an ordering, or it throws NotSupportedException",
        "ToPageEnumerable streams 100 rows per round trip, not configurable"
      ]
    }
